icon.png — PLACEHOLDER NOTE
===========================

The Home Assistant add-on store displays `icon.png` (square, 128x128 PNG
recommended) and optionally `logo.png` for this add-on.

A real binary PNG is intentionally NOT committed by this packaging pass —
generating image assets is out of scope here. Before publishing the
add-on, drop a real `open_crop_steering/icon.png` (and `logo.png`) into
this directory. The `panel_icon: mdi:cannabis` in `config.yaml` is what
HA uses for the sidebar entry; the store icon is separate.

This `.README` file is a marker only and can be deleted once a real
icon.png is added.
